    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Breastfeeding Champions Course was conducted by the International Breastfeeding Lactation consultants in partnership with CIME for the very first time for AKU nurses and midwives working in the service line 4 and 5, and secondary hospitals. The aim was to prepare the learners with basic lactation skills so that they could assist postnatal mothers in lactation and improve breastfeeding outcomes in the hospital.",
